; predicates returning boolean: eq, neq, gt, lt, ge, le, member, etc.
; these define order relations on values.
; gt/lt/ge/le form a partial-order (reflexive, antisymmetric, transitive).
; eq/neq define equivalence classes.

(kosha op-class-relation
  (swarupa yantra sambandha dvi-ahara)
  (phala satya)
  (abheda partial-order))
